Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:14.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}NimCFA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}NIM ⇄ FCFA on MTN MoMo and Orange Money,\Nright inside Nimiq Pay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:14.00,Body,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}Cash out NIM to mobile money in FCFA, or top up NIM by paying with mobile money. A few taps, in French or English, for Cameroon and the CEMAC zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:14.00,Small,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}Nimiq Mini Apps Competition · Cycle III · On/Off-Ramp track · by Mbanya Dev
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:27.49,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Demo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:27.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}The live mini app from GitHub Pages, on Nimiq testnet. The order engine runs right in your browser. Outside Nimiq Pay a testnet preview wallet stands in; inside Nimiq Pay the same calls go through the mini app SDK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:31.04,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Home
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:31.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Your NIM balance, its value in FCFA at the live rate, and two big actions: cash out or top up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:37.77,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}1 · Cash out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:37.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Enter the FCFA you want to receive and a mobile money number. MTN MoMo or Orange Money is detected from the prefix, and the rate is locked for 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:48.50,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}1 · Cash out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:48.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}One approval sends NIM to the escrow address with the order memo. The engine checks sender, memo, amount and network on-chain, then pays out to mobile money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:54.76,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}1 · Paid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:54.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}10,000 FCFA sent to MTN MoMo. Transaction details link every step to the Nimiq testnet explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:01:07.72,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}2 · Automatic refund
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:01:07.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}What if the operator rejects the payout? The simulator fails numbers ending in 1 so we can show it: the NIM goes straight back to the sender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:14.49,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}2 · Refunded
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:14.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Refunded on-chain, with the reason and a reference. An unknown payout result is held for review instead of retried, so nobody is ever paid twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:25.82,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}3 · Top up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:25.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Pay FCFA by approving a USSD prompt on your phone. Once the operator confirms, NIM is sent to your Nimiq Pay address.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:30.86,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}3 · NIM delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:30.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Mobile money in, NIM out, in seconds on testnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:37.13,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Recent activity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:37.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Every order and its status on the home screen, refunds included, so users have a reason to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:48.04,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Bilingual
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:48.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}French and English. The app follows the Nimiq Pay host language and network.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:01:48.04,Tag,,0,0,0,,TESTNET · MOBILE MONEY SIMULATED · NO REAL FRANCS MOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:02:08.04,H2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}How it works
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:02:08.04,List,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}• App: Vite + React + @nimiq/mini-app-sdk: accounts, balance, send with memo, host language and network\N• Engine: TypeScript order engine (Hono routes, Nimiq JSON-RPC, @nimiq/core signing). This demo runs it in the browser; production runs the same code on Node or Deno\N• Price: CoinGecko NIM/EUR × 655.957 (fixed FCFA/EUR peg), 10-minute quotes\N• Mobile money: pluggable simulator, Fapshi or CamPay sandbox\N• Safety: deposit only from the order's wallet with its memo, automatic refunds, one payout attempt per order, masked phone numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:23.04,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}NimCFA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}mbanyadev.github.io/nimcfa\Ngithub.com/mbanyadev/nimcfa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:23.04,Body,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}Next: a real mobile money sandbox, testers in Cameroon, USDT cash-out and a local agent network.
